OL,3,GNEWSAKids' pitch damaged by vandals on
OL,4,Amotorbikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FVandals on motorbikes have left a
OL,7,Fchildren's football pitch unusable for
OL,8,Fsix months after ripping up the grass
OL,9,Fand causing "significant damage".
OL,11,FDeep tyre tracks were left across the
OL,12,Fpitch used by Huncoat United Junior
OL,13,FFootball Club.
OL,15,FThe club said it would cost about
OL,16,F#80,000 to secure and fix its two
OL,17,Fpitches at Bolton Avenue Recreation
OL,18,FGround.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
