OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAKids' pitch damaged by vandals on
OL,4,Amotorbikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FClub treasurer John Stitt said the ruts
OL,7,Fleft by the damage were dangerous for
OL,8,Fplayers, but that it was too late in
OL,9,Fthe year to resow the grass. "We're now
OL,10,Feffectively out until late spring," he
OL,11,Fsaid.
